Version 4
SymbolType CELL
LINE Normal 0 0 16 0
LINE Normal 64 0 80 0
RECTANGLE Normal 16 -8 64 8
LINE Normal 16 -32 16 -8
LINE Normal 64 -32 64 -8
TEXT 40 20 Center 1 Kelvin
WINDOW 0 40 -40 Bottom 2
WINDOW 3 40 24 Top 2
WINDOW 39 40 56 Top 1
SYMATTR Prefix X
SYMATTR Value CSS4J_4026
SYMATTR SpiceLine R=1m
SYMATTR Description 4-terminal (Kelvin) current-sense shunt, Bourns CSS4J-4026 style. Pins F1 S1 S2 F2: force F1-F2, sense S1 (F1 end) and S2 (F2 end). Requires CSS4J.lib.
SYMATTR ModelFile CSS4J.lib
PIN 0 0 LEFT 8
PINATTR PinName F1
PINATTR SpiceOrder 1
PIN 16 -32 TOP 8
PINATTR PinName S1
PINATTR SpiceOrder 2
PIN 64 -32 TOP 8
PINATTR PinName S2
PINATTR SpiceOrder 3
PIN 80 0 RIGHT 8
PINATTR PinName F2
PINATTR SpiceOrder 4
